    'ryoyu-kobayashi-profile',
    '{"en": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: Japan''s Ski Jumping Phenomenon", "de": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: Japans Skisprung-Phänomen", "fr": "Ryoyu Kobayashi : Le phénomène japonais du saut à ski", "it": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: Il fenomeno giapponese del salto con gli sci", "es": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: El fenómeno japonés del salto de esquí", "pt": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: O fenômeno japonês do salto de esqui", "nl": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: Japans schansspringfenomeen", "ar": "ريويو كوباياشي: ظاهرة القفز على الجليد اليابانية", "ja": "小林陵侑：日本のスキージャンプ現象", "zh": "Ryoyu Kobayashi: Riben Huaxue Tiaoyue Qicai", "ko": "고바야시 료유: 일본 스키점프의 현상"}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "The Japanese superstar achieved the rare Grand Slam of ski jumping and continues to dominate on the World Cup circuit. A generational talent who flies with precision.", "de": "Der japanische Superstar erreichte den seltenen Grand Slam des Skispringens und dominiert weiterhin im Weltcup.", "fr": "La superstar japonaise a réalisé le rare Grand Chelem du saut à ski et continue de dominer le circuit de la Coupe du monde.", "it": "La superstar giapponese ha raggiunto il raro Grand Slam del salto con gli sci e continua a dominare nel circuito di Coppa del Mondo.", "es": "La superestrella japonesa logró el raro Grand Slam del salto de esquí y sigue dominando el circuito de la Copa del Mundo.", "pt": "A superestrela japonesa alcançou o raro Grand Slam do salto de esqui e continua dominando o circuito da Copa do Mundo.", "nl": "De Japanse superster behaalde de zeldzame Grand Slam van het schansspringen en blijft domineren in het Wereldbekercircuit.", "ar": "حقق النجم الياباني الجراند سلام النادر للقفز على الجليد ويستمر في الهيمنة على دورة كأس العالم", "ja": "日本のスーパースターはスキージャンプのグランドスラムを達成し、ワールドカップサーキットで支配を続けています。", "zh": "Riben juxing shixian le huaxue tiaoyue de xijian da manchuan, bing jixu zai Shijie Bei saisaidao shang zhangkong.", "ko": "일본 슈퍼스타는 스키점프의 드문 그랜드슬램을 달성하고 월드컵 서킷에서 계속 지배하고 있습니다."}'::jsonb,
    '{"en": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi has established himself as one of the most dominant <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">ski jumpers</a> of his generation. The Japanese star achieved the sport''s Grand Slam and continues to compete at the highest level season after season.</p><h2>Grand Slam Achievement</h2><p>Kobayashi accomplished something extraordinarily rare in ski jumping - the Grand Slam. This means winning all four events of the prestigious Four Hills Tournament in a single season. Only a handful of jumpers in history have achieved this feat.</p><p>This accomplishment alone would cement his legacy, but Kobayashi has continued to add to his trophy collection.</p><h2>Technical Mastery</h2><p>What makes Kobayashi special is his combination of explosive power off the jump and incredible control in the air. His technique allows him to maximize distance while maintaining perfect landing form.</p><p>He adapts quickly to different hill profiles and wind conditions, making him dangerous on any venue.</p><h2>World Cup Dominance</h2><p>Kobayashi has won multiple World Cup overall titles, proving his consistency across an entire season. He competes against the world''s best including <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a>, <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>, and rising stars like the Prevc family.</p><h2>Japanese Tradition</h2><p>Kobayashi carries forward Japan''s proud ski jumping heritage. Following legends who came before him, he has inspired a new generation of Japanese jumpers.</p><h2>Competitive Fire</h2><p>Despite his success, Kobayashi remains hungry for more victories. His focus and determination make him a threat to win every competition he enters, keeping fans on the edge of their seats.</p>", "de": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi hat sich als einer der dominantesten <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">Skispringer</a> seiner Generation etabliert. Der japanische Star erreichte den Grand Slam des Sports.</p><h2>Grand Slam Erfolg</h2><p>Kobayashi erreichte etwas außerordentlich Seltenes im Skispringen - den Grand Slam. Das bedeutet, alle vier Events der prestigeträchtigen Vierschanzentournee in einer Saison zu gewinnen.</p><h2>Technische Meisterschaft</h2><p>Was Kobayashi besonders macht, ist seine Kombination aus explosiver Kraft und unglaublicher Kontrolle in der Luft.</p><h2>Weltcup-Dominanz</h2><p>Er kämpft gegen die Weltbesten wie <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> und <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>.</p>", "fr": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi s''est imposé comme l''un des <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">sauteurs à ski</a> les plus dominants de sa génération. La star japonaise a réalisé le Grand Chelem du sport.</p><h2>Réalisation du Grand Chelem</h2><p>Kobayashi a accompli quelque chose d''extraordinairement rare dans le saut à ski - le Grand Chelem. Cela signifie gagner les quatre épreuves de la prestigieuse Tournée des Quatre Tremplins en une seule saison.</p><h2>Maîtrise technique</h2><p>Ce qui rend Kobayashi spécial, c''est sa combinaison de puissance explosive et de contrôle incroyable dans les airs.</p><h2>Domination en Coupe du monde</h2><p>Il affronte <a href=\"/stefan-kraft-profile/\">Stefan Kraft</a> et <a href=\"/halvor-granerud-profile/\">Halvor Egner Granerud</a>.</p>", "it": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi si è affermato come uno dei <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltatori con gli sci</a> più dominanti della sua generazione. La star giapponese ha raggiunto il Grand Slam dello sport.</p><h2>Traguardo del Grand Slam</h2><p>Kobayashi ha realizzato qualcosa di straordinariamente raro nel salto con gli sci - il Grand Slam. Significa vincere tutti e quattro gli eventi del prestigioso Torneo dei Quattro Trampolini in una sola stagione.</p><h2>Maestria tecnica</h2><p>Ciò che rende speciale Kobayashi è la sua combinazione di potenza esplosiva e controllo incredibile in aria.</p>", "es": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi se ha establecido como uno de los <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltadores de esquí</a> más dominantes de su generación. La estrella japonesa logró el Grand Slam del deporte.</p><h2>Logro del Grand Slam</h2><p>Kobayashi logró algo extraordinariamente raro en el salto de esquí - el Grand Slam. Esto significa ganar los cuatro eventos del prestigioso Torneo de los Cuatro Trampolines en una sola temporada.</p><h2>Maestría técnica</h2><p>Lo que hace especial a Kobayashi es su combinación de potencia explosiva y control increíble en el aire.</p>", "pt": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi se estabeleceu como um dos <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">saltadores de esqui</a> mais dominantes de sua geração. A estrela japonesa alcançou o Grand Slam do esporte.</p><h2>Conquista do Grand Slam</h2><p>Kobayashi realizou algo extraordinariamente raro no salto de esqui - o Grand Slam. Isso significa vencer os quatro eventos do prestigiado Torneio dos Quatro Trampolins em uma única temporada.</p>", "nl": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi heeft zich gevestigd als een van de meest dominante <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">schansspringers</a> van zijn generatie. De Japanse ster behaalde de Grand Slam van de sport.</p><h2>Grand Slam prestatie</h2><p>Kobayashi presteerde iets buitengewoon zeldzaams in het schansspringen - de Grand Slam. Dit betekent het winnen van alle vier evenementen van het prestigieuze Vierschansentoernooi in één seizoen.</p>", "ar": "<p>أثبت ريويو كوباياشي نفسه كأحد أكثر <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">القافزين على الجليد</a> هيمنة في جيله. حقق النجم الياباني الجراند سلام للرياضة.</p><h2>إنجاز الجراند سلام</h2><p>حقق كوباياشي شيئاً نادراً للغاية في القفز على الجليد - الجراند سلام. هذا يعني الفوز بجميع الأحداث الأربعة لبطولة التلال الأربع المرموقة في موسم واحد.</p>", "ja": "<p>小林陵侑は、彼の世代で最も支配的な<a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">スキージャンパー</a>の一人として確立しました。日本のスターはスポーツのグランドスラムを達成しました。</p><h2>グランドスラム達成</h2><p>小林はスキージャンプで非常にまれなことを成し遂げました - グランドスラム。これは、名誉あるフォーヒルズトーナメントの4つのイベントすべてを1シーズンで勝つことを意味します。</p><h2>技術的な熟練</h2><p>小林を特別にしているのは、爆発的なパワーと空中での信じられないほどのコントロールの組み合わせです。</p>", "zh": "<p>Ryoyu Kobayashi yi chengwei tade shidai zhong zui zhupei de <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">huaxue tiaoyue</a> yundongyuan zhiyi. Riben juxing shixian le yundong de da manchuan.</p><h2>Da manchuan chengjiu</h2><p>Kobayashi zai huaxue tiaoyue zhong shixian le feichang xijian de shiqing - da manchuan. Zhe yiweizhe zai yige saiji zhong yinx le zhenmingde sitian tiaotai bisai de suoyou si xiang saishi.</p>", "ko": "<p>고바야시 료유는 그의 세대에서 가장 지배적인 <a href=\"/ski-jumping-guide/\">스키점프</a> 선수 중 하나로 자리매김했습니다. 일본 스타는 스포츠의 그랜드슬램을 달성했습니다.</p><h2>그랜드슬램 달성</h2><p>고바야시는 스키점프에서 매우 드문 것을 달성했습니다 - 그랜드슬램. 이는 명망 있는 포힐스 토너먼트의 네 가지 이벤트를 모두 한 시즌에 우승하는 것을 의미합니다.</p><h2>기술적 숙련</h2><p>고바야시를 특별하게 만드는 것은 폭발적인 파워와 공중에서의 놀라운 제어력의 조합입니다.</p>"}'::jsonb,
    'athlete-profile',
